<title>UK: TMCC sets 200 billion lire five-year bond.</title>
<headline>TMCC sets 200 billion lire five-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Credito Italiano</p>
<p> BORROWER   TOYOTA MOTOR CREDIT CORP</p>
<p> AMT    200 BLN ITL   COUPON     6.625     MATURITY    10.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.575   PAY DATE    10.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (M) 5-50	SALE LIMITS US/K/IT</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  JAPAN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.625     SELL CONC  1.25	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
